  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Prevention and Peace Forum (CPPF) is an NGO working with dialogue in on-going and anticipated conflicts. CPPF works closely    with the UN system and in particular the Department for Political Affairs and its Mediation Support Unit, especially in contexts and situations where the UN has difficulties in getting involved. The organisation arranges meetings and provides analysis on conflicts.</narrative>
